===== Docker client-install E2E (ubuntu:24.04 + compose) =====
stamp:   2026-10-29T01:26:50Z
image:   mpd-docker-e2e:local
command: node scripts/docker-e2e.ts   (container: docker/entrypoint.sh)

PROVES: a clean ubuntu:24.04 container installs node/bun/pnpm + @deepseek-ai/dsh,
        copies this checkout, rebuilds every packages/*/dist from source, installs the
        bundle with `dsh plugin --profile web add .`, composes the mpd rows, and MOUNTS
        the installed profile in an isolated HOME/DSH_HOME with registration
        instrumentation (docker/probe.ts) reading the live tool registry, plus a real
        `POST /api/session/create` with agentPreset=mpd (the gateway refuses on an
        inactive preset row).
DOES NOT PROVE: any live LLM turn (no credentials are staged, AGENTS.md §10); that the
        COMPOSED row list equals the MOUNTED row list (the dump is labelled composition
        only); a packed/tarball install (dist/mpd-package is not exercised here).

